draw((-11,0)--(11,0));

for (i = -10; i <= 10; ++i) {
  draw((i,-0.2)--(i,0.2));
}

label("$a$", (0,-0.2), S);
label("$b$", (-2,-0.2), S);
label("$b$", (2,-0.2), S);
[/asy]

We then place a label of $c$ on every point that is three units away from a point labelled $b$:

[asy]
