solution:
We extend $QR$ to meet $TS$ at $X$. [asy]
import olympiad;
size(6cm); // ADJUST

pair p = (0, 6);
pair q = (3, 6);

pair r = (3, 3);
pair t = (0, 0);
pair s = (7, 0);
pair x = (3, 0);

draw(p--q--r--s--t--cycle);
draw(r--x);

label("$P$", p, NW);
label("$Q$", q, NE);
label("$R$", r, E + NE);
label("$S$", s, SE);
